              "value": "Glare of Rage"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(arcane, enchantment, mental, visual)\n\nThe dragonscarred dead focuses its boundless frustration in a gaze targeting one creature it can see within 30 feet. That creature must attempt a 30 Will save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is stunned 1.\n- **Failure:** The creature is stunned for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is stunned for 1d4 rounds and is fatigued."
